// Windows Event Log Cleared
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_event_log_clearing.yml (95343c97-8d4a-4284-935e-5b7b124ffc2d)
// Level: high. ATT&CK: T1685.005 Clear Windows Event Logs
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and ((process.executable:"*\\wevtutil.exe" and (process.command_line like~ ("* cl *", "* clear-log *"))) or ((process.executable like~ ("*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe")) and (process.command_line like~ ("*Clear-EventLog*", "*Remove-EventLog*"))))
